  "badges": [
    {
      "type": "origins:tooltip",
      "sprite": "origins:textures/gui/community/silent/badge/shapes/shape_heart.png",
      "text": "§e§lDamage Resistances:§r§f All damage (-15%). Most damage except fire, freezing, magic, void, and wither receives an additional -20%.\n \n§c§lDamage Vulnerabilities:§r§f Iron weapons (+20%).\n \n§e§lEffect Immunities:§r§f None."
    },
    {
      "type": "origins:tooltip",
      "sprite": "origins:textures/gui/community/silent/badge/colors/red.png",
      "text": "§c§lStone Venom:§r§f For the duration: §c§lRestrained§r§f and §c§lPoison I§r§f. Prevents knockback. Affected creatures can §e§lStruggle§r§f.\n \n§e§lStruggle:§r§f Rapidly pressing direction keys.\n \n§c§lRestrained:§r§f Prevents movement, movement abilities and elytra flight."
    }
  ],
  "name": "Passive Features",
  "description": "§e§lStats:§r\n+15% Movement Speed\n \n§e§lFeatures:§r\n- Melee hits inflict Poison I and Slowness I for 2 seconds. Hitting a Slowed target refreshes the duration and increases Slowness by one level. Striking a target at Slowness V applies §c§lStone Venom§r for 5 seconds.\n- You see perfectly in darkness and can climb vertical surfaces.\n- Fire extinguishes after no more than 3 fire-damage ticks.\n- Carrying or wearing any iron-tagged item anywhere in your inventory applies Wither I. Iron weapons also deal 20% more damage to you and apply Wither I on hit.\n- You can only eat raw foods; valid foods are four times as effective.\n- Falling more than 6 blocks reduces your movement speed by 30% for 10 seconds.\n- Creatures wearing pumpkins are immune to Ophidian Gaze and Transference.",
